  {
    "name": "FW Bunsen Burner 2",
    "displayName": "Weapon Testing",
    "description": "A test ship with new weaponry is in orbit around <planet>. Fight and disable it (but do not destroy it!) and then land to give Dr. Cardona feedback on its performance.",
    "raw": [
      {
        "key": "landing",
        "values": [],
        "children": null
      },
      {
        "key": "name",
        "values": [
          "Weapon Testing"
        ],
        "children": null
      },
      {
        "key": "description",
        "values": [
          "A test ship with new weaponry is in orbit around <planet>. Fight and disable it (but do not destroy it!) and then land to give Dr. Cardona feedback on its performance."
        ],
        "children": null
      },
      {
        "key": "source",
        "values": [
          "Rust"
        ],
        "children": null
      },
      {
        "key": "to",
        "values": [
          "offer"
        ],
        "children": [
          {
            "key": "has",
            "values": [
              "FW Bunsen Burner 1: done"
            ],
            "children": null
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "on",
        "values": [
          "offer"
        ],
        "children": [
          {
            "key": "conversation",
            "values": [],
            "children": [
              {
                "key": "You received a message recently from Barmy Edward, asking you to stop by the Kraz Cybernetics facility to help test a new weapon. Do you want to visit them now?",
                "values": [],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "choice",
                "values": [],
                "children": [
                  {
                    "key": "\t(Yes.)",
                    "values": [],
                    "children": null
                  },
                  {
                    "key": "\t(No.)",
                    "values": [],
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "key": "defer",
                        "values": [],
                        "children": null
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "key": "\tThe Kraz Cybernetics receptionist points you in a familiar direction, towards the hangar where Barmy Edward does his work. You do not find him there; instead, you are greeted by one of his colleagues: \"Good afternoon. Captain <last>, is it? I'm Dr. Chris Cardona. I work with Mr. Edward on the occasional project, including this latest prototype. We had some - uh - technical difficulties with the fuel injection component, and Mr. Edward is on temporary medical leave. Not to worry, he left me with clear instructions regarding your assignment.\"",
                "values": [],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "\tHe seems unfazed by this state of affairs.",
                "values": [],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "\tJust as before, you are to engage our test ship in combat in orbit above <planet> and attempt to disable it without causing permanent damage to its hull. In this case, it is a salvaged Falcon, the Red Hammer.\"",
                "values": [],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "choice",
                "values": [],
                "children": [
                  {
                    "key": "\t\"Technical difficulties?\"",
                    "values": [],
                    "children": null
                  },
                  {
                    "key": "\t\"Medical leave?\"",
                    "values": [],
                    "children": null
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "key": "\t\"Yes, the fuel injector came loose and doused the hangar with hyperspace fuel. It didn't ignite, but Mr. Edward inhaled enough of the vapours to put him out of action for a few weeks. Thankfully, the lab was not damaged, and production of test units is still on schedule.\"",
                "values": [],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "choice",
                "values": [],
                "children": [
                  {
                    "key": "\t\"For science!\"",
                    "values": [],
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "key": "accept",
                        "values": [],
                        "children": null
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "key": "\t\"For Edward!\"",
                    "values": [],
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "key": "accept",
                        "values": [],
                        "children": null
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "key": "\t\"Sorry, I'd rather not end up like Edward. I don't want to be involved.\"",
                    "values": [],
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "key": "decline",
                        "values": [],
                        "children": null
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "npc",
        "values": [
          "save",
          "disable"
        ],
        "children": [
          {
            "key": "personality",
            "values": [
              "staying",
              "heroic"
            ],
            "children": null
          },
          {
            "key": "government",
            "values": [
              "Test Dummy"
            ],
            "children": null
          },
          {
            "key": "ship",
            "values": [
              "Falcon (Bunsen)",
              "Red Hammer"
            ],
            "children": null
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "on",
        "values": [
          "complete"
        ],
        "children": [
          {
            "key": "event",
            "values": [
              "bunsen burner available",
              30
            ],
            "children": null
          },
          {
            "key": "conversation",
            "values": [],
            "children": [
              {
                "key": "You return to Kraz Cybernetics to deliver your report to Dr. Cardona. As you approach the hangar, he steps outside, removes a respirator and pair of safety goggles from his face, and rushes forward to meet you.",
                "values": [],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "\t\"Captain <last>, you're back so soon? Come, let us discuss your findings in my office, where the air is - uh - better conditioned. It's humid out here, no?\"",
                "values": [],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "\tYou follow him to his office, away from the hangar, and away from an unusual smell which has begun to fill the air.",
                "values": [],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "\t\"The weapon worked well, I presume?\"",
                "values": [],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "choice",
                "values": [],
                "children": [
                  {
                    "key": "\t\"Indeed.\"",
                    "values": [],
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "key": "goto",
                        "values": [
                          "good"
                        ],
                        "children": null
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "key": "\t\"I was able to neutralize it without much effort.\"",
                    "values": [],
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "key": "goto",
                        "values": [
                          "bad"
                        ],
                        "children": null
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "key": "label",
                "values": [
                  "good"
                ],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "\t\"Glad to hear it.\"",
                "values": [],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "\tHe glances at the figures displayed on his monitor.",
                "values": [],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "\t\"Yes, the data we've collected remotely seem to meet our expectations.\"",
                "values": [],
                "children": [
                  {
                    "key": "goto",
                    "values": [
                      "end"
                    ],
                    "children": null
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "key": "label",
                "values": [
                  "bad"
                ],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "\t\"I see. Surely that speaks more to the effectiveness of your ship's cooling system than to any deficiency in the prototype.\"",
                "values": [],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "choice",
                "values": [],
                "children": [
                  {
                    "key": "\t\"Indeed.\"",
                    "values": [],
                    "children": null
                  },
                  {
                    "key": "\t\"Don't call me Shirley.\"",
                    "values": [],
                    "children": null
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "key": "label",
                "values": [
                  "end"
                ],
                "children": null
              },
              {
                "key": "\t\"You should be able to find production models at our distributors within one to two months. On behalf of Kraz Cybernetics, I thank you for your assistance. Mr. Edward will be pleased to hear of our success.\" You bid Dr. Cardona farewell, and return to your ship.",
                "values": [],
                "children": null
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "locations": [
      "landing"
    ],
